cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this portfolio, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "Digital Heritage Portfolio"
abstract: >-
  Research on the lifecycle of multidimensional data for tangible, intangible
  and natural heritage, from digitisation to preservation and machine-readable
  reuse. The focus is on semantic data models and 3D rendering standards that
  support interfaces for interpreting heritage in research, education,
  creative and policy contexts.
